  "instructions": [
    "Preheat your robata-grill to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Rinse the rainbow trout fillets and pat them dry with paper towels.",
    "Season the trout fillets with Middle Eastern spice blend, salt, and pepper.",
    "Place the trout fillets on the robata-grill and cook for 4-5 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Meanwhile, mix together Greek yogurt, crushed red pepper flakes, and chopped parsley in a small bowl.",
    "Remove the trout from the grill and place it on a bed of lemon slices.",
    "Top each trout fillet with a dollop of yogurt mixture and a sprinkle of feta cheese.",
    "Drizzle with olive oil and serve immediately."
